  "about": "PROPOSAL, awaiting the user's approval (AGENTS rule 7). Nothing reads this file; it is not in the catalog. The rank names per culture for the catalog key command.rankNames (docs/design/CHAIN_OF_COMMAND.md §1.7 and §10). Keys are the catalog's culture ids (the keys of cultures); 'default' serves a culture that has no sets of its own. Each set has an id (saved per band as rankSet, §1.7), a label for people reading the file, and ranks 1 (the base) to 7 (the head of a band of up to 1093 people). 'female' is given only where the word is gendered; otherwise 'name' is used for everyone. A rank above 7 shows the rank-7 name. Written 2026-09-19 by Claude Code's naming review from three independent proposals. Revised the same day after a review: the automata's Array set is replaced by the Glass garrison, written by the naming review (CHAIN_OF_COMMAND.md §10.3).",
